    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Resolved native request. All byte spans and radio are borrowed during create. Native creation never changes mixer settings or reads tuning EEPROM. Radio generation/frame bounds/publication cadence are set by native lifecycle; effective released ABI-4 radio settings are otherwise preserved. Inactive signaling fields are normalized by the typed radio configuration. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
